{'symbol': 'JBHT', 'date': '2021-10-21 12:23:00', 'title': 'J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES PAYMENT OF DIVIDEND', 'text': 'LOWELL, ARK.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC. (NASDAQ: JBHT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED THE REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $ 0.30 (THIRTY CENTS) PER COMMON SHARE, PAYABLE TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 5, 2021. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON NOVEMBER 19, 2021. ABOUT J.B. HUNT J.B. HUNT TRANSPORT SERVICES, INC., AN S&P 500 COMPANY, PROVIDES INNOVATIVE SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS FOR A VARIETY OF CUSTOMERS THROUGHOUT NORTH A'}